gametitle=Phantasy Star Universe: Ambition of the Illuminus (USA) [SLUS-21631]
comment=DNAS bypass (PSU project). Sony's DNAS servers are gone, so the check can never pass.

// Generated by extract/bypass.py from patches/bypass.json. Do not hand-edit.
// Unlabelled on purpose: a [Section] patch is a toggleable cheat that defaults to OFF.
// Game module ERX/PSU_US.GZ loads at 0x23ce00. Every write is guarded by an E-type compare of the site's
// relocated retail low halfword, so nothing is written before the module is in memory or
// over other code (a memory-card System File build), and once written the guard goes quiet.
//
//   va 0x350584  jal DNAS status poll (stub 0x4e2fd8, import 0x10) -> b 0x350600 (the poll's 'operation complete' path)
//   va 0x350808  jal DNAS op1 start (stub 0x4e2fd0, import 0xf) -> move v0, zero (started OK)
//   va 0x350758  jal DNAS op2 start (stub 0x4e2fc0, import 0xd) -> move v0, zero
//   va 0x3506b0  jal DNAS op3 start (stub 0x4e2fc8, import 0xe) -> move v0, zero

